      "text": "A screenshot of the header of the mHealthEvidence.org website (by K4Health), showing the site logo with a magnifying glass icon, a 'Translate' link, a 'mHealth Evidence Taxonomy' link, 'Sign in' and 'Register' buttons, and a 'Go to...' search/navigation dropdown.",
